L1: A blinded, placebo‐controlled study on the clinical effects of vitamin E supplementation in dogs with osteoarthritis
L2: Journal of Veterinary Internal Medicine (2023)
L3: Casey L. Gordon, Samantha J. Reeves, Richard K. Burchell, Craig Thomson, Arnon Gal, Nicolas Lopez‐Villalobos, Natalie S. L. Webster, Kimberley M. Litster, Richard A. S. Mitchell
